"priority":5,"questId":76501,"showRandomTalkCount":0},"dialogs":[{"nodeId":765010101,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":7174,"speakerName":"ラウマ","textMapHash":1288054050,"text":"#パイモン、{NICKNAME}。森の鳥たちがそなたたちのことを話しておった。何か用だろうか？それとも…私に道を示してほしいのか？","nextNodeIds":[765010102,765010103]},{"nodeId":765010102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1453143210,"text":"この辺りを見てまわってただけだよ。","nextNodeIds":[765010104]},{"nodeId":765010104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":7174,"speakerName":"ラウマ","textMapHash":738593114,"text":"ここは月華に満ちておる。草木も、この地に生息する生き物たちも、外の世界とはまるで異なる。","nextNodeIds":[765010105]},{"nodeId":765010105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":7174,"speakerName":"ラウマ","textMapHash":1818073242,"text":"故に、ここでは確かに貴重な写真がたくさん撮れるであろう。","nextNodeIds":[765010106]},{"nodeId":765010106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":7174,"speakerName":"ラウマ","textMapHash":73378130,"text":"ぜひ自由にまわっていってくれ。もし気になることがあれば、いつでも私に聞くがよい。できる限り答えよう。","nextNodeIds":[765010107,765010108]},{"nodeId":765010107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2234160442,"text":"ここはとても静かだね。","nextNodeIds":[765010109]},{"nodeId":765010109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":7174,"speakerName":"ラウマ","textMapHash":804070234,"text":"ああ。ここは私が瞑想する場であり、万物と囁き合い、交流する場でもある。","nextNodeIds":[765010110]},{"nodeId":765010110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":7174,"speakerName":"ラウマ","textMapHash":3235381610,"text":"ここに立っているだけで、心が落ち着くのだ。","nextNodeIds":[765010111]},{"nodeId":765010111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2868924834,"text":"わぁ、なんだか詩的な感じがするな！","nextNodeIds":[765010112,765010113]},{"nodeId":765010112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2333291658,"text":"その、実はちょっとお願いがあるんだけど…","nextNodeIds":[765010114]},{"nodeId":765010114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2327900234,"text":"うんうん、ラウマはここに立ってるだけで、すっごく絵になるもんな！写真機で撮ったら、きっとすごく綺麗だぞ！","nextNodeIds":[765010115]},{"nodeId":765010115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":7174,"speakerName":"ラウマ","textMapHash":3780924346,"text":"…写真を？それは私にとって珍しい体験だ。もしこの静けさと私の姿が、そなたの写真機で収めるに値すると感じるのなら、喜んで協力しよう。","nextNodeIds":[765010116]},{"nodeId":765010116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":7174,"speakerName":"ラウマ","textMapHash":1221691810,"text":"これがそなたたちの旅の素敵な思い出になるのであれば、私も嬉しく思う。","nextNodeIds":[765010117]},{"nodeId":765010117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":7174,"speakerName":"ラウマ","textMapHash":425876546,"text":"では、私はどうすればよい？視線をどこかに固定したほうがよいか？それとも、いつも通りにしていればよいのか？","nextNodeIds":[765010118,765010119]},{"nodeId":765010118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1423717714,"text":"いつも通りにしてくれればいいよ。","nextNodeIds":[765010120]},{"nodeId":765010120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":7174,"speakerName":"ラウマ","textMapHash":3386109466,"text":"では、あとは任せよう。目を惹く瞬間を捉えられるよう祈っておる。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":765010119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2613765626,"text":"一番素敵な瞬間を捉えてみせるよ。","nextNodeIds":[765010120]},{"nodeId":765010113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2210640706,"text":"写真を撮らせてくれない？","nextNodeIds":[765010114]},{"nodeId":765010108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":549928354,"text":"ラウマは普段この辺りにいるの？","nextNodeIds":[765010109]},{"nodeId":765010103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2293256106,"text":"ついでにいい被写体を探してるんだ。","nextNodeIds":[765010104]}]},{"talkId":7650104,"talkConfig":{"checkActionAfter":false,"crowdLOD0List":[],"decoratorID":0,"disableTalkReview":false,"dontBlockDaily":false,"enableCameraDisplacement":false,"extraLoadMarkId":[],"finishExec":[{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EX